      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just words. a rewrite implies there's still something left to save. but it's not just the job, it's the whole feeling of being... a relic. like, the world has moved on to a different version of reality and i'm just a ghost haunting a system that doesn't need me. how do you find \"value\" in being a leftover? it just feels like an inefficiency at this point.",
